 leverage or collateral (margin net of unrealized PnL) changes, on mode switch, or after a 10s hold (MARGIN_REMOVAL_FRESH_LIMIT_HOLD_MS). Submissions after that are re-checked against a fresh read.","created_at":"2026-09-24T10:28:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T10:28:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36775#discussion_r4092541884","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36775","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/comments/4092541884"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36775#discussion_r4092541884"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36775"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/comments/4092541884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":151,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4091373443,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":61,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/comments/4151252455","pull_request_review_id":5374271235,"id":4151252455,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOCG4DHc73bxXn","diff_hunk":"@@ -128,7 +144,22 @@ const PerpsAdjustMarginView: React.FC = () => {\n     inputAmount: marginAmount,\n   });\n \n-  const flooredMaxAmount = floorUsd(maxAmount);\n+  const { flooredMaxAmount, submitLimitAmount } = usePerpsFreshRemovalLimit({\n+    freshMaxAmount,\n+    setFreshMaxAmount,\n+    position,\n+    snapshotMaxAmount: floorUsd(maxAmount),\n+    exchangeMaxAmount,\n+    isAddMode,\n+  });\n+  const hasNoRemovableMargin =","path":"app/components/UI/Perps/Views/PerpsAdjustMarginView/PerpsAdjustMarginView.tsx","commit_id":"b729f32d3c3c3bca3b1c37130efe144aea2ada8c","original_commit_id":"b729f32d3c3c3bca3b1c37130efe144aea2ada8c","user":{"login":"geositta","id":85914066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTE0MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85914066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta","html_url":"https://github.com/geositta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geositta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Could we derive the submission blocking zero state from the exchange limit rather than the buffered Max? For a 10× long with $1,000 notional and $112 margin, Max offers $2. After a $3 unrealized loss, notional becomes $997 and margin becomes $109: the exchange limit is still $9.30, but the buffered Max becomes zero. This condition then disables Confirm for the previously selected $2 and shows \"No margin can be removed,\" despite that amount remaining valid. That bypasses the distinction this PR introduces between the suggested Max and the submission limit. Please keep an already entered amount submittable when it remains within `submitLimitAmount`, and apply the same correction to the bottom sheet.\n\n**Regression proof:** This PR introduces both the headroom reduced maximum and the unconditional zero-state submission block; on `main`, the example’s $2 remains below the unbuffered limit and is not blocked.\n\nThe calculation follows Hyperliquid’s documented transfer requirement: the greater of initial margin and 10% of position value. The additional 1% reserve is a client policy, not the exchange boundary. [Hyperliquid margining rules](https://hyperliquid.gitbook.io/hyperliquid-docs/trading/margining)\n\nThe added tests cover a declining **positive** buffered Max and a zero state where **both** limits are zero. They miss the case where buffered Max is zero while the exchange limit still covers the selected amount.\n","created_at":"2026-10-01T02:31:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T02:31:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36775#discussion_r4151252455","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36775","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/comments/4151252455"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pull/36775#discussion_r4151252455"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/36775"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MetaMask/metamask-mobile/pulls/comments/4151252455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":155,"original_line":155,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":72,"position":72,"subject_type":"line"}]